stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> processing: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
  processing --> committed: venta insertada (misma transacción)
  committed --> completed: respuesta 2xx guardada
  processing --> [*]: rechazo 4xx/5xx o ROLLBACK -> DELETE
  processing --> processing: reserva abandonada más de 120 s -> se retoma
  committed --> committed: reintento -> respuesta reconstruida {venta_id}
  completed --> completed: reintento -> respuesta guardada (Idempotent-Replayed)
  completed --> [*]: expires_at vencido (24 h)
